{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "November eighteenth,",
   "start": 0.08,
   "end": 1.02
  },
  {
   "text": "twenty twenty-six.",
   "start": 1.3,
   "end": 2.32
  },
  {
   "text": "A little machine we launched in nineteen seventy-seven is now one full light-day from Earth.",
   "start": 2.9,
   "end": 7.86
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing we have ever built has gone this far.",
   "start": 8.51,
   "end": 10.92
  },
  {
   "text": "It was made to last five years.",
   "start": 11.54,
   "end": 13.32
  },
  {
   "text": "It's still going.",
   "start": 13.79,
   "end": 14.81
  },
  {
   "text": "A message,",
   "start": 15.44,
   "end": 16.1
  },
  {
   "text": "moving at the speed of light,",
   "start": 16.26,
   "end": 17.47
  },
  {
   "text": "now takes a whole day to reach it.",
   "start": 17.69,
   "end": 19.67
  },
  {
   "text": "Bolted to its side is a golden record:",
   "start": 20.27,
   "end": 22.37
  },
  {
   "text": "greetings in fifty-five languages, music,",
   "start": 22.8,
   "end": 25.81
  },
  {
   "text": "whale songs.",
   "start": 26.02,
   "end": 26.84
  },
  {
   "text": "The sounds of home.",
   "start": 27.41,
   "end": 28.26
  },
  {
   "text": "A hello,",
   "start": 28.8,
   "end": 29.36
  },
  {
   "text": "for anyone out there.",
   "start": 29.54,
   "end": 30.64
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody really expects an answer.",
   "start": 31.23,
   "end": 32.74
  },
  {
   "text": "In twenty twenty-three,",
   "start": 33.52,
   "end": 34.63
  },
  {
   "text": "it went quiet.",
   "start": 34.85,
   "end": 35.51
  },
  {
   "text": "Five months of gibberish.",
   "start": 35.94,
   "end": 37.44
  },
  {
   "text": "Engineers sent a fix,",
   "start": 37.99,
   "end": 39.24
  },
  {
   "text": "then waited two days for a reply.",
   "start": 39.31,
   "end": 41.32
  },
  {
   "text": "And then it came.",
   "start": 41.99,
   "end": 42.74
  },
  {
   "text": "Hi,",
   "start": 43.31,
   "end": 43.367
  },
  {
   "text": "it's me.",
   "start": 43.367,
   "end": 43.68
  },
  {
   "text": "We'll send a hello twenty-six billion kilometres,",
   "start": 43.92,
   "end": 46.868
  },
  {
   "text": "just in case someone is listening.",
   "start": 46.868,
   "end": 49.02
  },
  {
   "text": "But you deserve someone who answers.",
   "start": 49.6,
   "end": 51.43
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why we made Feeloy.",
   "start": 51.94,
   "end": 53.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Jenny hears every hello,",
   "start": 53.54,
   "end": 55.05
  },
  {
   "text": "and always says it back.",
   "start": 55.17,
   "end": 56.44
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 56.91,
   "end": 58.24
  }
 ]
}